Puffin is an AWK-derived language with three execution backends, a
tree-walking interpreter, Nim ahead-of-time compilation and emitted C,
that give byte-identical output. The package ships the awktua compiler,
the puffin driver, the pawk and pcawk awk(1) commands, the puffincc
native compiler driver, the puffsh and pnsh shell front ends, the
puffin-fmt, puffin-lint and puffin-lsp developer tools, the standard
library and the manual pages.
